<section class="slide" id="overview" data-section><div class="slide-inner overview-grid"><div class="overview-copy"><div class="eyebrow">PRODUCT STRATEGY · AI & GENAI · ENTERPRISE PLATFORMS</div><h1>Building products<br/>from <span class="g">complex problems</span><br/>to <span class="g">measurable impact.</span></h1><p>Senior Product Manager with <b>10+ years of experience</b> across FinTech, Healthcare, Telecom and Enterprise IT — combining product strategy, business analysis, technology, data and execution to build scalable enterprise products.</p><div class="overview-metrics"><div class="overview-metric"><strong>10+</strong><span>YEARS EXPERIENCE</span></div><div class="overview-metric"><strong>12+</strong><span>ENTERPRISE APPLICATIONS</span></div><div class="overview-metric"><strong>4</strong><span>INDUSTRY ECOSYSTEMS</span></div><div class="overview-metric"><strong>0 → 1</strong><span>PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT</span></div></div><div class="expertise-title">CORE EXPERTISE</div><div class="expertise-grid">{expertise.map(([a,b])=><div class="expertise"><b>{a}</b><span>{b}</span></div>)}</div></div><div class="operating"><div class="operating-head"><h3>PRODUCT OPERATING MODEL</h3><span class="operating-pill">PROBLEM → PRODUCT → OUTCOME</span></div><div class="op-grid">{[['Business','FinTech · Health Tech · Telecom'],['AI & GenAI','AI Strategy · Copilot · LLMs'],['Automation','API-First · Microservices · Cloud'],['Data','SQL · Power BI · KPI Frameworks']].map(([a,b])=><div class="op-card"><h4>{a}</h4><p>{b}</p></div>)}<div class="op-center">Product<br/><small>Manoj Pant · Technical Product Manager</small></div></div><div class="op-bottom"><span>◎ STRATEGY<br/><small>Vision · Priorities · Roadmap</small></span><span>⚙ DELIVERY<br/><small>Build · Integrate · Deploy</small></span><span>▥ ADOPTION & OUTCOMES<br/><small>Scale · Measure · Impact</small></span></div></div></div></section>
